 sorbents  from Amla international are an essential  line of defence Calabrian a is uniquely  formulated and processed to rapidly  sequester mycotoxins this prevents  toxins from entering the blood here's  how it works  when the mycotoxin molecules enter the  stomach through contaminated feed they  are quickly absorbed by Caliburn  particles the porous structure of  Caliburn a and its specialized affinity  for the mycotoxin makes it the perfect  enter o servant when the bonded complex  moves through the small intestine the  mycotoxin stay bound preventing them  from being passed into the blood as a  result caliber and a reduces the  mycotoxin concentrations in the blood  helping to keep your poultry healthy and  productive the mycotoxin and enter o  sorbent are later excreted harmlessly  from your poultry Caliburn a enter o  sorbents are a powerful and necessary  barrier against my co toxicosis  you
 

